# HOME: the keys show one bank of sixteen clips. OCT+ and OCT- move the bank (four banks, no wrap); a key launches clip bank * 16 + key
tap HOME
expect bank 0
tapkey w1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
expect clip 1
tap OCT+
expect bank 1
tapkey w1
wait 3000
expect clip 17
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
tap OCT+
expect bank 3
tapkey w15
wait 3000
expect clip 63
shot clips64_bank4.png
tap OCT-
expect bank 2
tapkey w0
wait 3000
expect clip 32
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
tap OCT-
expect bank 0
tapkey w5
wait 3000
expect clip 5
shot clips64_bank1.png
